/*
 Localizable.strings (English).

 Keys are stable identifiers; values are the English copy. Code that builds text in
 code passes an English default as well, so an unbundled run and the tests still read
 in English. To add a language, copy this file to
 Resources/<language>.lproj/Localizable.strings, translate the values (never the
 keys), keep every %@ and %lld placeholder, then rebuild with Scripts/bundle-app.sh.

 Use Scripts/run.sh during development. `swift run` has no .lproj beside the binary,
 so SwiftUI would show the keys instead of the English values.
*/

